  "statement": "The 1st West Mains crew of 4 miners is missing after a seismic event and a power outage. Explore from the fresh air base. The exhausting main fan is on and cannot be shut down, stalled, or reversed. Power is energized up to the fresh air base and cannot be cut. This is a 3-entry section, numbered left to right: No. 1 and No. 2 intakes, No. 3 the return. Mine maps are not up to date. A backup team is available but cannot assist.",
